title: Frequency Illusion
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki
wikipedia: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frequency_illusion

aka the Baader-Meinhof phenomenon

The notion that once you are aware of something, suddenly you start noticing it all the time, seemingly way more frequently than you did before.